<title>TURKEY: Turk Ege bira 96 profits down 16 pct.</title>
<headline>Turk Ege bira 96 profits down 16 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996 final results</p>
<p>(billion lira unless stated)</p>
<p>    Per share profit (lira)     479.77  vs    772.05</p>
<p>    Net profit		    1,021.09  vs  1,217.14</p>
<p>    Net sales		    10,899.89  vs  4,893.89</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    1,763.34  vs  1,554.89</p>
<p>    Exceptional income	  1,129.10  vs    474.98</p>
<p>    Interest Paid		 1,560.98  vs     43.09</p>
<p>    Total debts		   4,787.25  vs  2,122.07</p>
<p>    Equity			  7,058.58  vs  3,753.69</p>
<p>    Capital			 2,128.29  vs  1,576.51</p>
<p>NOTE - Brewer Ege Biracilik ve Malt Sanayii A.S. is largely owned by Turkish brewery, automotive and stationery group Anadolu Endustri Holding.</p>
<p>The figures above do not take into account Turkey's 84.9 percent wholesale inflation in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul Newsroom +90-212-2750875 GUZ EKS</p>
</text>
